• Session temporary stale-session reap complete: removed 1 session(s). All sessions were considered regardless of age; the current session, sessions with a fresh lease or held lock, invalid records, and unsafe entries were preserved. Reaping uses managed locks and leases to protect the current and genuinely live sessions.
